 "description": "Bug hunt 2026-11-28, finding 1.3: the full-screen equipment window shows what is worn (the worn grid stays hidden by design), opens the first worn item when the bag is empty, and uses the game button colours so the slot buttons and \"Назад к герою\" are readable.",
 "edits": [
